{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "composer",
  "title": "Composer",
  "group": "Chat",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The reply box under a conversation: a rounded field that grows with the text, Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a new line, and one round send button that stays disabled until there is something to send.",
    "id": "Kotak balasan di bawah percakapan: kolom membulat yang tumbuh mengikuti teks, Enter untuk mengirim, Shift+Enter untuk baris baru, dan satu tombol kirim bulat yang nonaktif sampai ada yang bisa dikirim."
  },
  "titleId": "Composer",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Send a question",
        "desc": "Type and press Enter (or the button). Your message joins the column and the answer streams in. Shift+Enter adds a line instead of sending.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cp-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation\">\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Ask me about Disdukcapil services: e-KTP, KK, birth certificates, moving letters.</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const c = document.getElementById('cp-chat'); const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); c.append(m); const a = document.createElement('div'); a.className = 'msg msg--ai is-new'; const ab = document.createElement('div'); ab.className = 'bubble'; a.append(ab); setTimeout(() => { c.append(a); import('../../js/lds.js').then((d) => d.streamText(ab, 'Good question. For a new e-KTP you need your KK and a surat pengantar from your RT/RW. Bring both to the Disdukcapil counter or your kecamatan office; recording takes about 15 minutes.')); }, 400);\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Ask about Disdukcapil services\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Ask about Disdukcapil services\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => {\n    addMyMessage(e.detail.text); // the textarea is already cleared and focused\n    askAssistant(e.detail.text);\n  });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "With an attach button",
        "desc": "Tools sit before the textarea and keep the 44 px hit area. Send stays the only filled control.",
        "html": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Attach a file\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">attach_file</span></button>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Describe the problem you found\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Grows with the text",
        "desc": "A long draft grows the box line by line up to 200 px, then scrolls inside. The button stays at the bottom, next to the last line.",
        "html": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\">I moved from Metro to Kedaton, Bandar Lampung last month and my KK still shows the old address.\nDo I need a surat pindah from Metro first, or can the kelurahan in Kedaton handle it?\nWhich documents should I bring?</textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kirim pertanyaan",
        "desc": "Ketik lalu tekan Enter (atau tombolnya). Pesan Anda masuk ke kolom dan jawaban mengalir masuk. Shift+Enter menambah baris, bukan mengirim.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cp-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Percakapan\">\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Tanyakan tentang layanan Disdukcapil: KTP elektronik, KK, akta kelahiran, surat pindah.</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const c = document.getElementById('cp-chat'); const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); c.append(m); const a = document.createElement('div'); a.className = 'msg msg--ai is-new'; const ab = document.createElement('div'); ab.className = 'bubble'; a.append(ab); setTimeout(() => { c.append(a); import('../../js/lds.js').then((d) => d.streamText(ab, 'Pertanyaan bagus. Untuk KTP elektronik baru, siapkan KK dan surat pengantar RT/RW. Bawa keduanya ke loket Disdukcapil atau kantor kecamatan; perekaman sekitar 15 menit.')); }, 400);\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\" placeholder=\"Tanya tentang layanan Disdukcapil\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\" placeholder=\"Tanya tentang layanan Disdukcapil\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => {\n    addMyMessage(e.detail.text); // the textarea is already cleared and focused\n    askAssistant(e.detail.text);\n  });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dengan tombol lampiran",
        "desc": "Alat ada sebelum textarea dan mempertahankan area sentuh 44 px. Tombol kirim tetap satu-satunya kontrol berisi warna.",
        "html": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Lampirkan berkas\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">attach_file</span></button>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\" placeholder=\"Jelaskan masalah yang Anda temukan\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Tumbuh mengikuti teks",
        "desc": "Draf panjang membuat kotak tumbuh baris demi baris sampai 200 px, lalu bergulir di dalam. Tombol tetap di bawah, di samping baris terakhir.",
        "html": "<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\">Saya pindah dari Metro ke Kedaton, Bandar Lampung bulan lalu dan KK saya masih memakai alamat lama.\nApakah saya perlu surat pindah dari Metro dulu, atau bisa diurus di kelurahan Kedaton?\nDokumen apa saja yang harus dibawa?</textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>"
      }
    ]
